# RULE (CLAUDE.md, "Presence-not-emptiness is now FOUR stores deep"):
#   A stored highlighter list that is EMPTY is the user having deleted every
#   rule and must stay deleted; only its ABSENCE seeds HighlighterSet::defaults().
#   M21 re-expressed the presence test as a std::optional, which is exactly when
#   it is easiest to lose.
#
# GUARD: tst_sessiongui::aDeletedDefaultRuleStaysDeletedAcrossARelaunch
#
# SILENT WHEN BROKEN: the three level colours come back on every launch, which
# is the shape of a bug nobody can get rid of.

